error[B0210]: `===` compares objects, and `Point` is a value
  --> check/identity.bloom:11:3
   |
11 |   a === b || n !== 1 || s === "x"
   |   ^ no identity: a struct, an enum, a number, a string or a collection is its value
   |
help: compare it with `==`
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#43-soundness-rules

